  "details": "I wish there was an option to switch the left and right joysticks on VR devices like quest and vive.  I suffer from joystick drift and it ruins the immersion for me. I learned fortunately that you can assign custom button placements, so, When you have Left joystick to rotate your character, and Right Joystick to move them in all directions, You can assign X to jump and A to mute.",
